{"id":951,"date":"2020-09-24T19:03:26","date_gmt":"2020-09-24T19:03:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=951"},"modified":"2020-12-18T15:19:21","modified_gmt":"2020-12-18T15:19:21","slug":"discover-eat-it-forward-program","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/discover-eat-it-forward-program\/","title":{"rendered":"Discover Eat It Forward Program"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Discover Eat It Forward Program Official Rules<\/span><br \/>\n<!--more--><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>Discover is giving $5 million to Black-owned restaurants.\u00a0<\/strong><strong>Nominate your favorite Black-owned restaurant for a $25,000 award. Tell Discover about your favorite Black-owned restaurant and nominate it using social media!<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">This year, COVID-19 hurt the restaurant industry\u2014especially Black-owned businesses\u2014and has disproportionately impacted the Black community. We support Black-owned restaurants as part of our commitment to fighting systemic racism and injustice and driving change to create a diverse, inclusive and equitable place for people to work and live.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Discover Eat It Forward Official Rules: Use social media to nominate a Black-owned restaurant, through October. You can submit up to five nominations per social media channel.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0(1) On Twitter: Tag the restaurant and @Discover and use hashtags #EatItForward and #Sweepstakes in your post to submit your nomination.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">(2) On Instagram: Post a photo and make sure you tag the restaurant and @Discover and use hashtags #EatItForward and #Sweepstakes to submit your nomination.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">(3) On Facebook: Leave a comment with the name of the restaurant on posts on the Discover page that asks for nominations for the #EatItForward program.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\" data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Each week Discover will randomly draw award recipients from all the nominees that have been entered to that point. There will be 200 different restaurants that will receive a $25,000 award.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><em>Once a nomination is submitted, it will be included in every subsequent drawing. Each restaurant\/owner is eligible to receive one award.<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Discover Eat It Forward Program Official Rules<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":952,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-951","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/951","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/rdrcnews"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/952"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=951"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}